                      "stable_id": "93794b25-8535-4e4f-af59-483b16e6e75c",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "For vLLM, configuration includes LMCache enablement, cache storage path, policy, limits, eviction policy, namespace/session binding, and compatibility mode with model profile."
