                      "stable_id": "85200f13-4d22-4e5f-a8de-d23811d8fe13",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "Estimate responses may include cache_reuse_possible, estimated_cache_hit_tokens, effective_new_tokens, and cache_estimate_quality when pre-execution cache information is available."
                    },
                    {
